### Level 2 requests (VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client). Cookies are kept between requests automatically.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### Register (role is always "user")
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.test", "password": "secret123" }

### Login as the seeded admin (credentials from .env / .env.example)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@codveda.test", "password": "Admin@12345" }

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Or use the Bearer token instead of the cookie
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Categories (public)
GET {{base}}/categories

### Create category (admin)
POST {{base}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Audio Gear", "description": "Headphones and speakers" }

### Products: search + filter + sort + paginate
GET {{base}}/products?search=keyboard&sort=price&page=1&limit=10

### Create product (logged in) — replace category id
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Studio Headphones", "price": 99, "stock": 4, "category": "<categoryId>" }

### Update product (owner or admin)
PATCH {{base}}/products/<productId>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 89 }

### Add a review
POST {{base}}/products/<productId>/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Great!" }

### List users (admin)
GET {{base}}/users

### Promote a user (admin)
PATCH {{base}}/users/<userId>/role
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "admin" }

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
